{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Little Worm for Your Desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your <strong>own tiny desktop worm pet</strong>. It <strong>moves when you type, click, or play with a gamepad</strong>. Every input makes it crawl a bit further until it reaches the screen edge and <strong>turns around</strong>. It is small, calm, and just hangs out with you while you use your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/46c2039ee362b768a8b0f652767bff4c.poster.avif?t=1763668964\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/46c2039ee362b768a8b0f652767bff4c.webm?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/46c2039ee362b768a8b0f652767bff4c.mp4?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pocket Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want less movement, put it in Pocket Mode. The worm sits in a <strong>small pocket on your screen</strong> and its <strong>head follows your mouse cursor</strong>. It stays close, quietly judging your life choices while you work and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/628619f44cf4cb43bf80c5c02d18c3de.poster.avif?t=1763668964\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/628619f44cf4cb43bf80c5c02d18c3de.webm?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/628619f44cf4cb43bf80c5c02d18c3de.mp4?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items &amp; Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you use your PC, you <strong>earn points </strong>by typing and clicking. Spend those points on <strong>item drops</strong> to unlock <strong>new hats and skins</strong>. Make your worm <strong>cute, silly, stylish, or totally cursed</strong> \u2013 it is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/d3e43eb6a2700a62287057c979f1cfad.poster.avif?t=1763668964\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/d3e43eb6a2700a62287057c979f1cfad.webm?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/d3e43eb6a2700a62287057c979f1cfad.mp4?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Common (85%),\u00a0Uncommon (10%), Rare (4%), Epic (0.95%), Legendary (0.05%)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Upgrading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have <strong>duplicate items</strong> or styles you do not use?\u00a0<strong>Combine items </strong>of the same rarity to craft one from the next tier. You can also <strong>feed items to your worm</strong> to add more body segments, so it slowly <strong>grows</strong> longer over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/85ab0950fefda0d3ce84a386aa6f0683.poster.avif?t=1763668964\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/85ab0950fefda0d3ce84a386aa6f0683.webm?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/85ab0950fefda0d3ce84a386aa6f0683.mp4?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Comfort Settings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>scale the worm</strong> to be <strong>tiny or big</strong>, just how you like it. Resize the pocket, and adjust <strong>many settings\u00a0</strong>to make your companion feel cozy on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/26656f97b60fc662089441e4f7cfc934.poster.avif?t=1763668964\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/26656f97b60fc662089441e4f7cfc934.webm?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/26656f97b60fc662089441e4f7cfc934.mp4?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made for Focus &amp; Breaks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Pomodoro timer</strong> to <strong>work in gentle focus blocks</strong> with clear breaks. Turn on the <strong>Anti-Shrimp stretch reminder</strong> so the worm can remind you to sit up straight, stand up, and stretch. It is a <strong>small, friendly nudge</strong> to take better care of yourself while you are at your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044170?t=1763668964","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/ca63d7dc5f6e79833e6cff044778fe7236ab722b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763668964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/a20f00935156d3003d40393c02a11878650e24bf/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1763668964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/a20f00935156d3003d40393c02a11878650e24bf/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1763668964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Little Worm for Your Desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your <strong>own tiny desktop worm pet</strong>. It <strong>moves when you type, click, or play with a gamepad</strong>. Every input makes it crawl a bit further until it reaches the screen edge and <strong>turns around</strong>. It is small, calm, and just hangs out with you while you use your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/46c2039ee362b768a8b0f652767bff4c.poster.avif?t=1763668964\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/46c2039ee362b768a8b0f652767bff4c.webm?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/46c2039ee362b768a8b0f652767bff4c.mp4?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pocket Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want less movement, put it in Pocket Mode. The worm sits in a <strong>small pocket on your screen</strong> and its <strong>head follows your mouse cursor</strong>. It stays close, quietly judging your life choices while you work and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/628619f44cf4cb43bf80c5c02d18c3de.poster.avif?t=1763668964\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/628619f44cf4cb43bf80c5c02d18c3de.webm?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/628619f44cf4cb43bf80c5c02d18c3de.mp4?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items &amp; Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you use your PC, you <strong>earn points </strong>by typing and clicking. Spend those points on <strong>item drops</strong> to unlock <strong>new hats and skins</strong>. Make your worm <strong>cute, silly, stylish, or totally cursed</strong> \u2013 it is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/d3e43eb6a2700a62287057c979f1cfad.poster.avif?t=1763668964\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/d3e43eb6a2700a62287057c979f1cfad.webm?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/d3e43eb6a2700a62287057c979f1cfad.mp4?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Common (85%),\u00a0Uncommon (10%), Rare (4%), Epic (0.95%), Legendary (0.05%)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Upgrading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have <strong>duplicate items</strong> or styles you do not use?\u00a0<strong>Combine items </strong>of the same rarity to craft one from the next tier. You can also <strong>feed items to your worm</strong> to add more body segments, so it slowly <strong>grows</strong> longer over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/85ab0950fefda0d3ce84a386aa6f0683.poster.avif?t=1763668964\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/85ab0950fefda0d3ce84a386aa6f0683.webm?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/85ab0950fefda0d3ce84a386aa6f0683.mp4?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Comfort Settings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>scale the worm</strong> to be <strong>tiny or big</strong>, just how you like it. Resize the pocket, and adjust <strong>many settings\u00a0</strong>to make your companion feel cozy on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/26656f97b60fc662089441e4f7cfc934.poster.avif?t=1763668964\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/26656f97b60fc662089441e4f7cfc934.webm?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/26656f97b60fc662089441e4f7cfc934.mp4?t=1763668964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made for Focus &amp; Breaks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Pomodoro timer</strong> to <strong>work in gentle focus blocks</strong> with clear breaks. Turn on the <strong>Anti-Shrimp stretch reminder</strong> so the worm can remind you to sit up straight, stand up, and stretch. It is a <strong>small, friendly nudge</strong> to take better care of yourself while you are at your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Kinychanchan"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/1ec3e68f9f228ef06427707b75874e205c4c8655/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1763668964","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044170/1609094169/641f14cea29be5a8ca5f445e789fcad3fa736648/1762729975/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762803510","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044170/1609094169/641f14cea29be5a8ca5f445e789fcad3fa736648/1762729975/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762803510","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044170/1609094169/641f14cea29be5a8ca5f445e789fcad3fa736648/1762729975/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762803510","id":257228882,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257228882/movie480.mp4?t=1762803510","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257228882/movie_max.mp4?t=1762803510"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257228882/15a89346c1475717dfa7621272cdae26ca1a0033/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762803510","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257228882/movie480.webm?t=17628035