am/apps/4044170/b1ca151de5cba121c119dcb2df303f4d4c0d396e/ss_b1ca151de5cba121c119dcb2df303f4d4c0d396e.600x338.jpg?t=1763668964"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/3854fa0d8cb31c1cb3b7eabe776136fd1f9a2a0c/ss_3854fa0d8cb31c1cb3b7eabe776136fd1f9a2a0c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763668964","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/3854fa0d8cb31c1cb3b7eabe776136fd1f9a2a0c/ss_3854fa0d8cb31c1cb3b7eabe776136fd1f9a2a0c.600x338.jpg?t=1763668964"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/9082f7f2a43b78ac562773401cf1f4df08f0fd6e/ss_9082f7f2a43b78ac562773401cf1f4df08f0fd6e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763668964","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/9082f7f2a43b78ac562773401cf1f4df08f0fd6e/ss_9082f7f2a43b78ac562773401cf1f4df08f0fd6e.600x338.jpg?t=1763668964"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/bf23892815d133d6c9c620d1d6d06cf37864f5b8/ss_bf23892815d133d6c9c620d1d6d06cf37864f5b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763668964","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/bf23892815d133d6c9c620d1d6d06cf37864f5b8/ss_bf23892815d133d6c9c620d1d6d06cf37864f5b8.600x338.jpg?t=1763668964"}],"short_description":"A tiny desktop worm pet that moves when you type, click, or play. Dress it up with hats and skins, park it in a pocket where its gaze follows your mouse, and let its Anti-Shrimp reminders nudge you to sit up and stretch.","steam_appid":4044170,"support_info":{"email":"contact@kinychanchan.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swed